      "mergeID": "64500babdcbedc09168f2087",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Before the beta, when timing out, clicking on \"retry\" will simply reloads the current instance. \n\nNow, it will often send you in your home. So rejoining your friends takes additional steps and an additional loading screen.\n\nAlso the timing out error message is often out of the view (this is on desktop, not vr) and is triggered twice on my end.\n\nI know it's currently not possible for VRChat to dynamically recover a connection drop, but this is a regression compared to the live version. I do have a lot of timing out, the other day 16 timing out before I was able to play, so this is really frustrating. Please improve the new timing out behavior.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Timing out behavior is worst than before",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "6439112640d89a090b0ad80b",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "this issue is happening to me as well and in my case the retry screen triggers more than 3 times and even more sometimes, and sometimes it even sends me to the error world",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
