      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{644de4d8ed4d5408fd3513f5|full_name}: For me the error message is always triggered 2-3 time, sometime out of the screen (cmon, it's just a screen space canvas, how this is even as issue (on desktop)? it's like they intentionally made it buggy), sometime it's locking the mouse movement horizontally, now it's sending me back in my home. So yea, I am pretty sure there is room for improvement around the current behavior.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
